<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - IDEX upgraded to 1-Buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - IDEX upgraded to 1-Buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Barrington Research analyst Walter Liptak said he upgraded IDEX Corp to 1-Buy from 2-Buy.</p>
<p>--Shares in the maker of fluid handling and other industrial products closed Friday at 39.</p>
<p>--&quot;A stable economic environment and modest improvement in domestic industrial production will be a big plus for IDEX,&quot; Liptak said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
